      "summary": "Version : v1.3.4",
      "content": "# Beacon v1.3.4 Change Document\n\n**Version**: `v1.3.4`\n**Status**: `generated`\n**Generated**: 2026-04-19 08:56\n\n## Scope\n- feature packages included: 3\n\n## Feature Packages\n- `beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane`: Landed runtime projection ledger support, split docs/runtime context alignment, and real-project board validation materials for the v1.3.4 management-board line.\n- `beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance`: Froze the runtime-evidence layering and noise-governance contract for Beacon supplement-line release closure.\n- `beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing`: Closed the structured-PRD and toolkit-skill surfacing requirement package so documented optional surfaces do not drift from host-visible routing.\n\n## Added\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] Beacon Runtime Ledger runtime projection helpers\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] real-project board validation checklist and acceptance materials\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] formal release-line boundaries, blueprint, and source-architecture package\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance] Formal runtime evidence layering PRD/user-story/test-case package\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance] AC-to-test closure matrix for runtime noise governance\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing] Formal structured-PRD generation and toolkit-surface repair requirement package\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing] AC-to-test closure matrix for PRD/toolkit drift repair\n\n## Removed / Reduced\n- none\n\n## Fixed\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] Aligned doctor context setup to overwrite stale onboarding docs version when an explicit docs line is selected\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] Allowed managed context to carry runtime and docs versions separately for v1.3.4 supplement-line projects\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane] Projected beacon, rolo, slow_uni_bmtop, and shopxo_canada into the runtime ledger with stable project semantics\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance] Clarified that runtime cache is corroboration and rebuild hint, not formal release truth\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance] Bound git-submitted machine evidence separately from local runtime/debug noise\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing] Mapped generic-PRD generation friction into a formal parallel PRD line\n- [beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing] Mapped toolkit skill visibility drift into a formal parallel PRD line\n\n## Traceability Refs\n- `beacon/commands/doctor.py`\n- `beacon/commands/status.py`\n- `beacon/utils/context_files.py`\n- `beacon/utils/doctor_orchestrator.py`\n- `beacon/utils/doctor_registry.py`\n- `beacon/utils/runtime_projection.py`\n- `beacon/utils/runtime_projection_store.py`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/prd/beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/user-story/beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/qa/test-cases/beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/.machine/change/beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane.json`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/change/beacon-v1.3.4-global-runtime-projection-and-pocketbase-control-plane.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/prd/beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/user-story/beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/qa/test-cases/beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/.machine/change/beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance.json`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/change/beacon-v1.3.4-runtime-evidence-layering-and-noise-governance.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/prd/beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/user-story/beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/qa/test-cases/beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing.md`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/.machine/change/beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing.json`\n- `docs/beacon/v1.3.4/change/beacon-v1.3.4-structured-prd-generation-and-toolkit-skill-surfacing.md`\n",
